# rows-enter (H4): Enter after typing "2.5" into a's field — the value set,
# the URL updated (a=2.5), the box showing "2.50".
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 360 432
wait 150
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
wait 100
type "2.5"
wait 200
key Enter
wait 400
shot rows-enter
